  27+ 9625 ED B0        	LDIR
  28+ 9627 01 FF 02     	LD BC,767
  29+ 962A 77           	LD (HL),a						 					; Atributos de pantalla, % 00 xxx xxx en [A].
  30+ 962B ED B0        	LDIR
  31+ 962D C9           	ret
